#: ../../library/onewire.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`onewire` --- 1-Wire bus protocol"
msgstr ":mod:`onewire` --- protokol sabirnice 1-Wire"

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`onewire` module implements the 1-Wire bus master protocol used by "
"devices such as the DS18x20 temperature sensor. It uses a single "
":py:class:`machine.Pin` configured as open-drain to communicate with one or "
"more slave devices on the shared bus."
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`onewire` implementira master protokol sabirnice 1-Wire koji "
"koriste uređaji poput senzora temperature DS18x20. Koristi jedan "
":py:class:`machine.Pin` konfiguriran kao open-drain za komunikaciju s jednim"
" ili više podređenih uređaja na zajedničkoj sabirnici."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:12
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Primjer::"

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:23
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Klase"

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:27
msgid ""
"Construct a 1-Wire bus master on the given :py:class:`machine.Pin`. The pin "
"is automatically configured as open-drain with a pull-up."
msgstr ""
"Stvara master sabirnice 1-Wire na zadanom :py:class:`machine.Pin`\\ . Pin se"
" automatski konfigurira kao open-drain s pull-up otpornikom."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:30
msgid "**ROM command constants:**"
msgstr "**Konstante ROM naredbi:**"

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:35
msgid ""
"Search ROM command (``0xF0``). Used internally by :meth:`scan` to discover "
"devices on the bus."
msgstr ""
"Naredba Search ROM (\\ ``0xF0``\\ ). Interno je koristi :meth:`scan` za "
"otkrivanje uređaja na sabirnici."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:41
msgid ""
"Match ROM command (``0x55``). Used internally by :meth:`select_rom` to "
"address a specific device by its 64-bit ROM code."
msgstr ""
"Naredba Match ROM (\\ ``0x55``\\ ). Interno je koristi :meth:`select_rom` za"
" adresiranje određenog uređaja prema njegovom 64-bitnom ROM kodu."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:47
msgid ""
"Skip ROM command (``0xCC``). Addresses all devices on the bus "
"simultaneously, skipping ROM matching."
msgstr ""
"Naredba Skip ROM (\\ ``0xCC``\\ ). Istovremeno adresira sve uređaje na "
"sabirnici, preskačući podudaranje ROM koda."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:50
msgid "**Bus reset:**"
msgstr "**Resetiranje sabirnice:**"

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:54
msgid ""
"Issue a reset pulse on the bus. Returns ``True`` if at least one slave "
"device responded with a presence pulse, otherwise ``False``. If *required* "
"is ``True`` and no device responds, raises :exc:`OneWireError`."
msgstr ""
"Šalje reset impuls na sabirnicu. Vraća ``True`` ako je barem jedan podređeni"
" uređaj odgovorio impulsom prisutnosti, inače ``False``\\ . Ako je "
"*required* postavljen na ``True`` i nijedan uređaj ne odgovori, podiže "
":exc:`OneWireError`\\ ."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:58
msgid "**Bit/byte I/O:**"
msgstr "**Bitni/bajtni U/I:**"

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:62
msgid "Read a single bit from the bus and return it as ``0`` or ``1``."
msgstr "Čita jedan bit sa sabirnice i vraća ga kao ``0`` ili ``1``\\ ."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:66
msgid "Read a single byte from the bus and return it as an integer (0--255)."
msgstr "Čita jedan bajt sa sabirnice i vraća ga kao cijeli broj (0--255)."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:71
msgid ""
"Read ``len(buf)`` bytes from the bus into the given pre-allocated buffer."
msgstr ""
"Čita ``len(buf)`` bajtova sa sabirnice u zadani unaprijed alocirani "
"međuspremnik."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:76
msgid "Write a single bit (``0`` or ``1``) to the bus."
msgstr "Zapisuje jedan bit (\\ ``0`` ili ``1``\\ ) na sabirnicu."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:80
msgid "Write a single byte (0--255) to the bus."
msgstr "Zapisuje jedan bajt (0--255) na sabirnicu."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:84
msgid "Write the bytes in *buf* to the bus."
msgstr "Zapisuje bajtove iz *buf* na sabirnicu."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:86
msgid "**Device addressing:**"
msgstr "**Adresiranje uređaja:**"

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:90
msgid ""
"Issue a reset followed by a MATCH ROM command to address the device whose "
"64-bit ROM code is in *rom* (an 8-byte buffer)."
msgstr ""
"Šalje reset nakon kojeg slijedi naredba MATCH ROM za adresiranje uređaja "
"čiji se 64-bitni ROM kod nalazi u *rom* (8-bajtni međuspremnik)."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:95
msgid ""
"Search the bus and return a list of 8-byte ROM codes (one ``bytearray`` per "
"detected device). Returns an empty list if no devices are present."
msgstr ""
"Pretražuje sabirnicu i vraća popis 8-bajtnih ROM kodova (po jedan "
"``bytearray`` za svaki otkriveni uređaj). Vraća prazan popis ako nema "
"prisutnih uređaja."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:99
msgid "**Cyclic redundancy check:**"
msgstr "**Ciklička provjera redundancije:**"

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:103
msgid ""
"Compute the Maxim/Dallas 8-bit CRC over *data*. The result is ``0`` when "
"*data* already includes a valid trailing CRC byte, which can be used to "
"validate received scratchpad contents."
msgstr ""
"Izračunava Maxim/Dallas 8-bitni CRC nad *data*\\ . Rezultat je ``0`` kada "
"*data* već sadrži valjani završni CRC bajt, što se može koristiti za "
"provjeru valjanosti primljenog sadržaja scratchpada."

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:108
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "Iznimke"

#: ../../library/onewire.rst:112
msgid ""
"Raised when a 1-Wire operation fails. Currently raised by "
":meth:`OneWire.reset` when *required* is ``True`` and no slave responds to "
"the reset pulse."
msgstr ""
"Podiže se kada operacija 1-Wire ne uspije. Trenutno je podiže "
":meth:`OneWire.reset` kada je *required* postavljen na ``True`` i nijedan "
"podređeni uređaj ne odgovori na reset impuls."
